      "reviewedAt": "2026-08-27T19:30:31Z",
      "note": "The earliest of the pinned source's 19 unique Ethereum exploit transactions is 0xa02c1801 in block 15724428; all 19 succeed from 0xb6875508 through one of two helpers and complete at 1665488891. Their traces contain 73 calls with selector 0x32854cc2 from those helpers into 0x6eb211ca, matching 73 positive ERC-20 transfers from non-cluster victims into the cluster and no positive cluster outflow. The target is absent at block 15518180, deployed by 0xfa4b69f8 at block 15518181 index 43, and has runtime hash 0xc721ffeb through the pre-anchor block. Both EIP-1967 slots are zero; the runtime contains neither DELEGATECALL nor SELFDESTRUCT, and the anchor trace contains no DELEGATECALL. Although the target is unverified on Etherscan, its runtime, traces, and the pinned reproduction establish the direct arbitrary-call failure."
    },
